Hi Grace,

Nothing missed on your side - the display names come from the mapping template, and line 2's template was loaded with only the tag column filled in. Two options:

1. Bulk rename: Settings > Sites > MOD-01/L2 > Export tags gives you a CSV. Fill in the "display_name" column and re-import it on the same page. Existing history stays attached to the tag; only the name shown to operators changes.
2. Send me the filled-in template and I'll load it for you. Same result, less clicking.

For the naming itself I'd follow what line 1 did: "<Station> <Measurement>", e.g. "Filler Temp 4". Operators find those in the exception report much faster than the PLC tags.

Best,
Yuki

